Can anyone point me in the direction of a source for the
Oriental game of GO.
(Its a game for two players, played on a 19 x 19 grid.  The
players take it in turns to place black and white 'stones'
onto this board, the object being to capture space by
surrounding the opponent's stones with your own.  At the
end of the game thenwinner is the player who has captured
most space.)

